s, it is.\", \"Yes, it's very cold in winter.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["Yes, it is very cold in winter.","Yes, it is.","Yes, it's very cold in winter."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Có, mùa đông ở đó rất lạnh.\"","id":"u8n7l2-e08","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Yes, it is very cold in winter."},{"id":"c2","text":"He is with my uncle."},{"id":"c3","text":"I am from Vietnam."}]},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"Yes, it is very cold in winter.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c1","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Có, mùa đông ở đó rất lạnh.\"","id":"u8n7l2-e08a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"Is it cold in Canada?\" — chọn câu trả lời phù hợp"},"skillIds":["speaking","u8.dialogue"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u1.canada","u8.cold","u8.winter"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u8.d5.n","locale":"en-US","text":"Is it cold in Canada?"},"skillIds":["speaking","u8.dialogue"],"type":"dialogueTurn","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u1.canada","u8.cold","u8.winter"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"It snows."},{"id":"c2","text":"It is very cold."},{"id":"c3","text":"It rains."}],"passage":"In Canada, Tom wears a coat in winter. It is very cold and there is snow. In Ho Chi Minh City, it is always hot. Today it is sunny in the morning. Tom does not take an umbrella. In the afternoon, the sky is cloudy and it starts to rain. Tom is outside! Mai has an umbrella. \"Here, Tom. Vietnam has two seasons: the dry season and the rainy season. Now it is the rainy season!\" Tom laughs. \"I love the weather here. It is never cold!\"","question":"What happens in the afternoon?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"It rains.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Tom và mùa mưa\".","id":"u8n7l2-e09",